---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../../components/Button.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Children Portfolio"
  description="Children photography portfolio by MellSnap. Natural and playful photos of children in London."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="label mb-4">Portfolio</p>
        <h1 class="text-primary-text">Children</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary-text mt-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Capturing the wonder, joy, and playful spirit of childhood.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        As a child photographer based in Kingston upon Thames, I focus on
        capturing genuine moments that reflect your child's unique personality.
        Whether it's a quick mini-session or a longer full-session, each package
        is designed to give you natural, candid shots that tell the story of
        your child's special moments.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/027-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little blonde boy sitting on a tree, while his mum is holding his hands, smiling for a photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/021-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little blonde boy sitting on a tree, while his mum is holding his hands, smiling for a photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/DSCF2274-2.jpg"
          alt="Little girl looking with her eyes up, children photography from Mellsnap"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Flexible Child Photography Sessions with No Hidden Costs
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        Time moves so quickly, and your little ones grow up before you know it.
        That's why capturing these precious moments is so meaningful. My
        sessions are designed to give you full flexibility – you'll receive both
        web and print-ready versions of your images, allowing you to print them
        whenever and wherever you like, without any extra costs or
        complications. Simple as that!
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/076-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little boy in a park for a family photoshoot with his family"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/005-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little boy in a park for a family photoshoot with his family"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/082-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little boy, doing soap bubbles in a park for a family photoshoot with his family"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Capturing Real Moments: My Approach as a Child Photographer
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        My sessions are child-led, ensuring that your little one is comfortable,
        relaxed, and able to be themselves. Whether we're outdoors in a local
        park or in the comfort of your own home, I create a fun and stress-free
        environment where real moments can shine through. Forget the stiff poses
        or forced smiles – I work with your child's natural energy and
        playfulness to create photos that truly reflect who they are.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/108-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little boy for his first birthday for a outdoor cake smash photoshoot in the park on a picnic blanket"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/122-Web.jpg"
          alt="Little boy for his first birthday for a outdoor cake smash photoshoot in the park on a picnic blanket"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/DSCF8645.jpg"
          alt="Little baby girl in yellow clothes, children photoshoot with Mellsnap. Outdoor family photo session in Hyde park"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Child Photography Packages
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        <strong>Mini-session</strong>
      </p>

      <ul class="text-secondary-text mb-6 list-disc pl-6">
        <li>Perfect for a quick and fun photoshoot.</li>
        <li>Up to 20 minutes per session.</li>
        <li>Around 20 images.</li>
        <li>
          Child photography mini-sessions are available only in Kingston upon
          Thames or nearby locations.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        <strong>Event Session</strong>
      </p>

      <ul class="text-secondary-text mb-6 list-disc pl-6">
        <li>Ideal for birthdays and child milestones.</li>
        <li>Over 80 images.</li>
        <li>1-hour session (extendable if needed).</li>
        <li>
          Location chosen by you in South-West or Central London. Additional
          charges may apply for other locations.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        <strong>Full Session</strong>
      </p>

      <ul class="text-secondary-text mb-6 list-disc pl-6">
        <li>
          Similar to the Event session, but limited to 1 hour, non-extendable.
        </li>
        <li>More than 80 images.</li>
        <li>
          A great option for capturing special moments in a relaxed, natural
          setting.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        With all packages, you'll receive fully edited, candid shots in an
        online gallery where you can securely share and download all the images.
        My goal is to capture the atmosphere and happiness of your child's
        important moments, preserving them in beautiful photographs you'll
        cherish forever.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/102-DSCF2373.jpg"
