          alt="Little girl holding her puppy for a photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/119-DSCF2410.jpg"
          alt="Twin girls for a family outdoor photo session from Mellsnap"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/108-DSCF2385.jpg"
          alt="Twin girl with their puppy for outdoor photo session"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <Image
          src="https://images.mellsnap.co.uk/file/mellsnap-website/portfolio/children/057-Web-e1731531799306.jpg"
          alt="Little girl holding her baby brother for a family photoshoot"
          inferSize
          class="aspect-square img-portfolio w-full h-auto object-cover"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Where Will Your Session Take Place?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        I photograph children mostly over South-West London or Central London,
        and sessions can take place either at your home or outdoors in a park.
        If your child loves the outdoors, we'll make use of the natural
        surroundings for a lively and fun shoot. If they feel more comfortable
        indoors, we can capture their joy and playfulness in familiar
        surroundings, ensuring every image feels authentic.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
