      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <h3 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-4">
        What should my child wear?
      </h3>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        For best results, I recommend lighter tones and avoiding busy patterns
        or logos. If you're unsure, feel free to send me a few outfit ideas
        beforehand, and I'll help you coordinate.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
