      <h2 class="text-primary-text font-bold mb-6">
        No Need to Worry About the Weather
      </h2>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        We all know how unpredictable the British weather can be, but there's no
        need to stress! If the weather takes a turn for the worse, we can easily
        reschedule your session for a day with better conditions. Your child's
        comfort and the quality of the photos are my top priorities, so we'll
        make sure the timing is just right.
      </p>

