      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-6">
        If you're looking for a child photographer who understands how to make
        sessions fun and relaxed, while delivering beautiful, candid photos,
        let's chat! Get in touch today to schedule your session and preserve
        these precious moments forever.
      </p>

      <p class="text-secondary-text mb-12">
        You can read more about <a
